    {
      "id": "claim_bd6619f54f0c49949f5b083b7e239c7c",
      "statement": "In the audio player, selecting a station via a button click clears any existing retry state (clearAudioRetry), marks the station as actively wanted (wasPlayingBeforeError = true), updates the active button and currentStation display, persists the station URL to localStorage under AUDIO_STORAGE_KEY = 'lastStationAudioUrl', restarts metadata polling if a data-metadata-url is present (otherwise shows 'Metadaten nicht verfügbar'), clears the Media Session, and sets audioPlayer.src followed by load().",
