      "id": "claim_cbfb1d8df7f04de68b6fc3f27ce38dec",
      "statement": "In the video player, selecting a station via a button click clears status messages, updates the currentStation display, initializes HLS playback via setupHlsPlayer (hls.js, native Safari HLS, or an unsupported-format message), and configures the Media Session with station name as title, 'Livestream' as artist, album 'Oidarwave Video', the video element as media, and clearMediaSession as onStop.",
