    {
      "id": "claim_cc674c567cf4429e84e26e70405c4683",
      "statement": "The video player initializes HLS playback either with hls.js (loaded from CDN on video/index.html; crossorigin=anonymous, xhrSetup with withCredentials=false, loadSource + attachMedia, MANIFEST_PARSED handler that plays, applies the data-save quality level and captions) or, on Safari, natively (crossorigin removed, src set directly, one-shot loadedmetadata handler that plays and applies captions); if neither is supported it logs HLS_FATAL and shows a persistent unsupported-format message. ERROR events are logged with codes mapped via window.HlsErrorMap and only fatal errors trigger recovery.",
