    {
      "id": "claim_85138beba3b04e06952441df47ce573a",
      "statement": "The audio player polls metadata every METADATA_REFRESH_INTERVAL = 3000 ms only while the page is visible and online, aborting the previous in-flight request via AbortController; it parses .txt as text (first line = title) or JSON via getMusicInfo (song_now_title/playlistItem.title and artist fields), formats 'title - artist', updates #currentSongTitle only on change, notifies window.notificationManager.handleTrackChange, and updates the Media Session; on failure it logs METADATA_FETCH, shows 'Metadaten nicht verfügbar', and clears the Media Session.",
