    {
      "id": "claim_ac69a1ffc3e6431cb484122b34762c74",
      "statement": "Both players integrate with the Media Session API through PlayerCore.setupMediaSession, which sets MediaMetadata (title/artist/album with fallbacks Livestream/Oidarwave Radio/Oidarwave, artwork from FAVICON_ARTWORK), de-duplicates identical metadata via lastMediaSessionKey, and registers play/pause/stop action handlers (stop also runs onStop, which both players set to clearMediaSession); clearMediaSession resets the key and sets metadata to null. The audio player updates it with track metadata on playing and on each successful metadata poll, the video player sets static station metadata on selectStation.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/js/player-core.js#L34-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:53eac727e784eefb7e4842705691fbdee73609c62811e839be0249d55a5611a4:"
