    {
      "id": "claim_9c45cf0d78c2470db730a63271bfe4ec",
      "statement": "The video player handles HLS errors in the Hls.Events.ERROR handler: the error type is mapped through window.HlsErrorMap to an HLS_* log code (HLS_FATAL when fatal); fatal NETWORK_ERROR retries via handleNetworkRetry with the same exponential backoff (hlsPlayer.startLoad(), destroying the instance and showing a persistent network-error message after MAX_RETRIES = 3), fatal MEDIA_ERROR calls recoverMediaError(), and any other fatal error destroys the HLS instance and shows a persistent 'Schwerwiegender Fehler' message; non-fatal errors are left to hls.js.",
      "evidence": [
