    {
      "id": "claim_453dde01cb134ddaa3854939eb65c9fc",
      "statement": "The playback workflow integrates with page visibility and online/offline events: on the radio page, hiding the tab stops metadata polling (interval cleared and in-flight fetch aborted) and showing it refreshes metadata and restarts the interval; offline clears the retry timer/message and stops the history session while online triggers refreshMetadata and, if hasError && wasPlayingBeforeError && src, an immediate retryAudio with the count clamped to MAX_RETRIES-1; on the video page, becoming visible resumes playback if not paused. Media Session metadata/action handlers are configured via PlayerCore.setupMediaSession and updated by the audio player on playing and metadata changes, and by the video player on station selection.",
      "evidence": [
