      "statement": "On the radio page, initializePlayer restores the last played station on load by readSetting(AUDIO_STORAGE_KEY = 'lastStationAudioUrl') matched against buttons via dataset.url equality (not an attribute selector, because URLs contain selector-hostile characters) and calls selectStation on the matching button, falling back to the first station button; the video page has no restore and always selects the first station button on load.",
