    {
      "id": "claim_85dc33075890449091895bbf63d5a515",
      "statement": "The radio-page selectStation performs the full chain in order: clearAudioRetry, wasPlayingBeforeError = true, setActiveStation, update currentStation display, writeSetting(lastStationAudioUrl), restartMetadataPolling (immediate fetch plus 3000 ms interval, or 'Metadaten nicht verfügbar'), clearMediaSession, then src = url and load; the playing event then starts StationHistory.startStation(src) and a baseline Media Session, and each successful metadata poll updates the title display, calls notificationManager.handleTrackChange, and refreshes the Media Session with track title/artist.",
